Preview a Quarto document or script

Usage: ir preview [OPTIONS] <SOURCE> [QUARTO_ARGS]...

Arguments:
  <SOURCE>          Quarto document or script to preview
  [QUARTO_ARGS]...  Arguments passed to `quarto preview`

Options:
      --with <PKG>                   Add a dependency for this preview; may be repeated
      --repo <REPO>                  Add a CRAN-like R package repository for this preview; may be repeated
      --r-version <SPEC>             Select the R version for this preview with rig
      --rscript <RSCRIPT>            Select the Rscript executable
      --exclude-newer <DATE>         Resolve packages from the Posit Package Manager snapshot at this date
      --python-exclude-newer <DATE>  Resolve Python packages using this snapshot date
      --isolated                     Disable the user library for this preview
      --vanilla                      Pass --vanilla to the Rscript used by Quarto
  -h, --help                         Print help

Examples:
  ir preview report.qmd
  ir preview report.qmd --port 4321

  ir preview --with ggplot2 report.qmd --no-browser
      # --with is for ir; --no-browser is passed to quarto preview.
